{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">保安局局長鄧炳強與深圳市副市長羅晃浩，視察新皇崗口岸大樓。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鄧炳強與羅晃浩一同前往大樓的港方口岸區，視察準備情況，之後舉行「港深口岸規劃建設工作專班」會議。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER-1800_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026n4Rh4HKVdE1787140031.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BORDER-1800_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鄧炳強指雙方一致同意完善合作查驗系統設施，和跨境全流程壓力演練，確保口岸啟用後安全、高效、暢順運作。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T12:05:50.223493+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}